1. The TQue buffer allocation might not be working correctly
2. The DataCopy calls might not be synchronizing properly
3. The coordinate decomposition might be wrong

Let me simplify the kernel to use a single row processing with proper synchronization. Instead of batching, let me process one element at a time with explicit PipeBarrier.

